Subject: Fit a normal curve with inlabru?
Message-ID: <gasJx4iWvbg.XFvi9Ax9AgAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/gasJx4iWvbg/m/XFvi9Ax9AgAJ>
